== In other shapes ==
Packing squares into other shapes can have high [[computational complexity]]: testing whether a given number of axis-parallel unit squares can fit into a given [[polygon]] is [[NP-complete]]. It remains NP-complete even for a [[simple polygon]] (with no holes) that is [[Orthogonal convexity|orthogonally convex]], with [[rectilinear polygon|axis-parallel sides]], and with [[half-integer]] vertex coordinates.<ref>{{citation
